@startuml
title RPG Character Creator - Save Character Sequence

actor "Authenticated User" as User
boundary "React Frontend" as Frontend
control "Express API" as API
participant "Supabase Auth" as Auth
database "PostgreSQL" as Database

User -> Frontend: Select character attributes
User -> Frontend: Click Save

Frontend -> API: PUT /api/characters/me\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT

API -> Auth: Validate access token
Auth --> API: Verified user or authentication error

alt Invalid or expired token

    API --> Frontend: 401 Unauthorized

else Authenticated user

    API -> API: Validate character data
    API -> API: Derive user_id from verified token

    alt Invalid character data

        API --> Frontend: 400 Bad Request

    else Valid character data

        API -> Database: Upsert character using\nuser-scoped credentials

        Database -> Database: Enforce RLS policies\nand UNIQUE(user_id)

        alt Database operation failed

            Database --> API: Database error
            API --> Frontend: Safe error response

        else Character saved

            Database --> API: Saved character
            API --> Frontend: 201 Created or 200 OK

        end
    end
end

Frontend --> User: Display operation result

@enduml